作者: 逃跑者(runner)
题目: brief of this war time
日期: Thu May 11 18:34:21 2000
*
1. Southern China becomes a big war zone. Almost every kingdom involved 
in big war. The northern China is relatively peaceful, except South
finished Yuan Shao off.

2. The big winner today is zzyx, he got his Chaisang back, and defeat
SunJian's attack with only 0.5k loss. Sunjian on the other hand lost 4k
in Chaisang offense and 2k in Chaisang defense previously. Obviously they
are loser in this war time. The performance of Xiaobai is outstanding,
feel so lucky that we don't have this kind of enemy. :)

3. Piaox's strategy is finishing southwest, I guess. They attack Jianning
this afternoon, but surprisingly lost to the Azi's npc troops. Later,
Azi dismiss all good npc (Jiang Wei, Yan Yan, Ji Lin), so I think he is
surrendering to Piaox. If Jianning lost, Lnwm will not stand any chance
to face Piaox. Right now, I think Piaox has 2 main force, one in
Chengdu, one in Jiangling. If Shangyong (bsnow) can attack Yongan, piaox
will be in big big trouble, but it looks like bsnow won't do it.

4. Currently, aopen face-up piaox in Xiabian. I don't think Aopen
stand a good chance in defending Xiabian. He has few players to support
him. We might need to consider recruit aopen and lnwm after 2-3 war time.

5. First time in history, Tianshui's gold balance its own army. Thank
you all for your help. I hope after Tianshui has 100k population, we can
move some good npc easter frontline lah.

6. It looks like foxer won't attack Taiyuan soon. I don't think foxer is
very ambitious from beginning. But I think Kingan always dream Taiyuan.
He just lack of soliders to achieve it right now. Don't know why he hestitate
to attack huguan now, maybe he is worried about his back. I think South has
some kind of truce with kingan. We shall look at this issue seriously.

Bow



